{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"“Steenrod 代数”"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"Steenrod代数"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>对于素数 $p$, 称 "},{"Local":{"url":"Eilenberg–MacLane谱","text":"Eilenberg–MacLane 谱"}},{"Plain":" $H\\mathbb F_p$ 到自身的映射代数为模 $p$ Steenrod 代数.</p>\n"}]}}